msgid "To run Remix Desktop and a local test node, use this Geth command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../run.md:176
msgid "Also see [Geth Docs on Dev mode](https://geth.ethereum.org/docs/developers/dapp-developer/dev-mode)"
